  (https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo), under the MIT License. Converted to ONNX Runtime's
  format.

- SFace face recognition, 8-bit (face_recognition_sface_2021dec_int8), from the OpenCV Zoo, under
  the Apache License 2.0. Converted to ONNX Runtime's format.

- TinyCLIP ViT-39M/16 + Text-19M, YFCC-15M (https://github.com/wkcn/TinyCLIP), Copyright (c)
  Microsoft Corporation, under the MIT License, as converted to ONNX in
  https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/TinyCLIP-ViT-39M-16-Text-19M-YFCC15M-ONNX, with its
  tokenizer's vocabulary and merge rules. Modified: split into its image and text halves, both reduced to 8-bit numbers where
